Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Web Form|
		|osgi.app.includes|web-form|
	And these variables
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Web Form|
		|osgi.app.includes|web-form|
		|pageName|Web Form Test Page|
		|portletName|Web Form|
Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And Page add
		|pageName|${pageName}|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|${pageName}|
	Then Portlet add PG
		|portletName|${portletName}|
Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Edit And Send Web Form With Required Checkbox
Priority: 4
	Given WebForm view PG
		|wfInformationDescription|Your input is valuable to us. Please send us your suggestions.|
		|wfInformationTitle|Suggestions|
	When Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|${pageName}|
	And WebFormPortlet configure Setup Form Fields PG
		|wfInformationDescription|Please let us know what you think!|
		|wfInformationTitle|Feed Back|
	And WebFormPortlet edit Field
		|wfFieldName|Name|
		|wfNewFieldName|Your Name|
	And WebFormPortlet edit Field
		|wfFieldName|Rating|
		|wfFieldType|Check Box|
		|wfNewFieldName|Rate Us!|
	And WebFormPortlet edit Field
		|wfFieldName|Comments|
		|wfNewFieldName|Additional Comments|
	And WebFormPortlet save Configuration
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|${pageName}|
	And WebForm view PG
		|wfInformationDescription|Please let us know what you think!|
		|wfInformationTitle|Feed Back|
	And WebForm view Form Field Text
		|wfFieldName|Your Name|
	And WebForm view Form Field Check Box
		|wfFieldName|Rate Us!|
	And WebForm view Form Field Text Box
		|wfFieldName|Additional Comments|
	And WebForm populate Field Text
		|wfFieldName|Your Name|
		|wfFieldValue|New Name|
	And WebForm populate Field Check Box
		|wfFieldName|Rate Us!|
		|wfFieldValue|true|
	And WebForm populate Field Text Box
		|wfFieldName|Additional Comments|
		|wfFieldValue|Page Objects + Hashi = Poshi|
	Then WebForm send PG
