Scenario: Edit Web Form And View Multiple Fields
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|${pageName}|
	When WebForm view PG
		|wfInformationDescription|Your input is valuable to us. Please send us your suggestions.|
		|wfInformationTitle|Suggestions|
	And WebForm view Form Field Text
		|wfFieldName|Name|
	And WebForm view Form Field Options
		|wfFieldName|Rating|
	And WebForm view Form Field Text Box
		|wfFieldName|Comments|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|${pageName}|
	And WebFormPortlet configure Setup Form Fields PG
		|wfInformationDescription|Please let us know what you think!|
		|wfInformationTitle|Feed Back|
	And WebFormPortlet edit Field
		|wfFieldName|Name|
		|wfNewFieldName|Test 1|
	And WebFormPortlet add Field
		|wfFieldName|Name|
		|wfNewFieldName|Test 2|
		|wfPreviousFieldName|Test 1|
	And WebFormPortlet edit Field
		|wfFieldName|Rating|
		|wfFieldType|Check Box|
		|wfNewFieldName|Rate Us!|
	And WebFormPortlet edit Field
		|wfFieldName|Comments|
		|wfNewFieldName|Additional Comments|
	And WebFormPortlet save Configuration
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|${pageName}|
	And WebForm view PG
		|wfInformationDescription|Please let us know what you think!|
		|wfInformationTitle|Feed Back|
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'Test 1' at locator 'xpath=(//div[contains(@class,'form-group')]/label[contains(@for,'WebFormPortlet')])[1]'
	And AssertElementPresent at locator 'xpath=(//fieldset/div/div[contains(@class,'form-group')]/input[@type='text'])[1]'
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'Test 2' at locator 'xpath=(//div[contains(@class,'form-group')]/label[contains(@for,'WebFormPortlet')])[2]'
	And AssertElementPresent at locator 'xpath=(//fieldset/div/div[contains(@class,'form-group')]/input[@type='text'])[2]'
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'Rate Us!' at locator 'xpath=(//div[contains(@class,'form-group')]/label[contains(@for,'WebFormPortlet')])[3]'
	And AssertElementPresent at locator '//div[contains(@class,'checkbox')]//input[@type='checkbox']'
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'Additional Comments' at locator 'xpath=(//div[contains(@class,'form-group')]/label[contains(@for,'WebFormPortlet')])[4]'
	Then AssertElementPresent at locator '//fieldset/div/div[contains(@class,'form-group')]/textarea'
Scenario: Edit Web Form And View Optional Check Box Field
Priority: 3
	Given WebForm view PG
		|wfInformationDescription|Your input is valuable to us. Please send us your suggestions.|
		|wfInformationTitle|Suggestions|
	When Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|${pageName}|
	And WebFormPortlet configure Setup Form Fields PG
	And WebFormPortlet delete Editable Field
		|wfFieldName|Name|
	And WebFormPortlet delete Editable Field
		|wfFieldName|Rating|
	And WebFormPortlet delete Editable Field
		|wfFieldName|Comments|
	And WebFormPortlet edit Field
		|optional|true|
		|wfFieldName|New Item|
		|wfFieldType|Check Box|
		|wfNewFieldName|Test Check Box Field|
	And WebFormPortlet save Configuration
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|${pageName}|
	And WebForm view PG
		|wfInformationDescription|Your input is valuable to us. Please send us your suggestions.|
		|wfInformationTitle|Suggestions|
	And WebForm view Form Field Check Box
		|wfFieldName|Test Check Box Field|
	Then WebForm send PG
