Scenario: Edit Web Form And View Paragraph Field
Priority: 4
	Given WebForm view PG
		|wfInformationDescription|Your input is valuable to us. Please send us your suggestions.|
		|wfInformationTitle|Suggestions|
	When Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|${pageName}|
	And WebFormPortlet configure Setup Form Fields PG
	And WebFormPortlet delete Editable Field
		|wfFieldName|Name|
	And WebFormPortlet delete Editable Field
		|wfFieldName|Rating|
	And WebFormPortlet delete Editable Field
		|wfFieldName|Comments|
	And WebFormPortlet edit Field
		|wfFieldName|New Item|
		|wfFieldType|Paragraph|
		|wfNewFieldName|Test Paragraph Field|
	And WebFormPortlet edit Paragraph Field
		|wfNewFieldName|Test Paragraph Field|
		|wfParagraphFieldText|Hello Liferay. This is the Test Paragraph Field.|
	And WebFormPortlet add Field
		|wfFieldType|Text|
		|wfNewFieldName|Test Text Field|
		|wfPreviousFieldName|Test Paragraph Field|
