Scenario: Send Web Form
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|${pageName}|
	When Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	And SelectFrame at locator 'WebFormConfiguration#CONFIGURATION_IFRAME'
	And WebFormPortlet view Editable Field
		|wfFieldName|Name|
	And WebFormPortlet view Editable Field
		|wfFieldName|Rating|
	And WebFormPortlet view Editable Field
		|wfFieldName|Comments|
	And SelectFrameTop the value 'relative=top'
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|${pageName}|
	And WebForm populate Field Text
		|wfFieldName|Name|
		|wfFieldValue|Test Test|
	And WebForm populate Field Options
		|wfFieldName|Rating|
		|wfFieldValue|Excellent|
	And WebForm populate Field Text Box
		|wfFieldName|Comments|
		|wfFieldValue|Page Objects + Hashi = Poshi|
	And WebForm send PG
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|${pageName}|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	And SelectFrame at locator 'WebFormConfiguration#CONFIGURATION_IFRAME'
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'There is existing form data. Please export and delete it before making changes to the fields.' at locator 'WebFormConfiguration#SETUP_FORM_FIELDS_INFO_MESSAGE'
	And WebFormPortlet view Editable Field Not Present
		|wfFieldName|Name|
	And WebFormPortlet view Submitted Field
		|wfFieldName|Name|
		|wfFieldType|Text|
	And WebFormPortlet view Editable Field Not Present
		|wfFieldName|Rating|
	And WebFormPortlet view Submitted Field
		|optionsList|Excellent,Good,Satisfactory,Poor|
		|wfFieldName|Rating|
		|wfFieldType|Options|
	And WebFormPortlet view Editable Field Not Present
		|wfFieldName|Comments|
	And WebFormPortlet view Submitted Field
		|wfFieldName|Comments|
		|wfFieldType|Text Box|
	Then SelectFrameTop the value 'relative=top'

